OL,3,ARussia says it is ready to resume talks
OL,4,Awith Ukraine and US to end war
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia is "ready in principle" to
OL,7,Fresume talks with the US and Ukraine on
OL,8,Fending the conflict, Vladimir Putin's
OL,9,Ftop aide has said.
OL,11,FYuri Ushakov was speaking after Putin
OL,12,Fmet US President Donald Trump's special
OL,13,Fenvoy Steve Witkoff in the Russian city
OL,14,Fof St Petersburg.
OL,16,FUshakov said a new round could be held
OL,17,Fnext month, and Ukraine's President
OL,18,FVolodymyr Zelensky later said he wanted
OL,19,Fthis to happen as soon as possible.
OL,20,FKyiv and its European allies have long
OL,21,Fbeen pressing Moscow for resumption of
OL,22,Fthe talks halted in February.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
