OL,3,ARussia says it is ready to resume talks
OL,4,Awith Ukraine and US to end war
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia has for months refused as it
OL,7,Fbelieves it is winning on the
OL,8,Fbattlefield with Ukraine facing an
OL,9,Facute shortage of interceptors against
OL,10,Fdeadly Russian missile attacks.
